1
00:00:22,778 --> 00:00:26,662
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,062 --> 00:00:33,677
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,550 --> 00:00:40,688
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,026 --> 00:00:47,035
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,246 --> 00:00:51,167
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,378 --> 00:00:54,469
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,766 --> 00:00:59,001
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:00,986 --> 00:01:03,894
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,192 --> 00:01:07,078
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,388 --> 00:01:12,170
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,170 --> 00:01:16,750
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,750 --> 00:01:18,749
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,952 --> 00:01:24,734
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,118 --> 00:01:29,429
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,429 --> 00:01:31,937
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,183 --> 00:01:42,400
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,850 --> 00:01:48,684
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,684 --> 00:01:51,602
=Episode 13=

19
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:09,719
Suzhen. Go on and try it.

20
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:10,840
Try it.

21
00:02:12,639 --> 00:02:13,840
Sure, Aunt.

22
00:02:15,599 --> 00:02:16,599
Is this braised pork?

23
00:02:16,599 --> 00:02:18,199
Yes, eat up.

24
00:02:18,199 --> 00:02:20,240
This meat looks delicious.

25
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:22,520
Balanced fat and lean, with a red sheen.

26
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:27,039
Xu Xian, you're always away
hunting demons,

27
00:02:27,199 --> 00:02:28,479
hardly ever having home cooking.

28
00:02:28,919 --> 00:02:30,280
Try it. I'm sure it's great.

29
00:02:30,439 --> 00:02:31,439
Of course, it is.

30
00:02:31,719 --> 00:02:33,800
Aunt's braised pork is the best.

31
00:02:35,479 --> 00:02:36,479
And this shrimp.

32
00:02:36,599 --> 00:02:38,360
Aunt's shrimp is the best.

33
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:39,520
Such a rich color.

34
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:41,159
You can tell it's fresh.

35
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:43,439
Uncle, you're busy with duty.

36
00:02:43,719 --> 00:02:44,919
You need to eat well.

37
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:49,280
Forgive my forgetfulness.

38
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:53,280
It's not like there's much going on
at the office.

39
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:58,520
Fahai.

40
00:03:00,759 --> 00:03:03,120
Here, look at this plate of greens.

41
00:03:04,159 --> 00:03:05,400
So fresh and crisp.

42
00:03:06,199 --> 00:03:08,680
This whole plate is for you.

43
00:03:08,719 --> 00:03:09,719
Here you go.

44
00:03:09,719 --> 00:03:10,759
I think Qing should

45
00:03:10,759 --> 00:03:12,280
have a piece of this meat.

46
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:34,960
It smells great.

47
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:39,400
But I think

48
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:41,639
the best dish tonight must be this fish.

49
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:44,080
It looks so tender and tasty.

50
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:47,400
Suzhen, try it.

51
00:03:51,319 --> 00:03:52,319
I think

52
00:03:52,599 --> 00:03:54,280
Aunt has been busy all day,

53
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:56,400
cooking such a wonderful feast.

54
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:58,080
I propose a toast.

55
00:03:58,080 --> 00:03:59,759
To Aunt, for all your hard work.

56
00:03:59,759 --> 00:04:01,599
- Right.
- To Aunt.

57
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:03,400
Why didn't I think of that?

58
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:05,800
- Cheers.
- Cheers, Aunt. Thank you.

59
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:07,400
- Thank you.
- Thank you, Aunt.

60
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:08,960
Thank you, my dear.

61
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,639
- Such fine wine.
- Such fine wine.

62
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:18,279
Alright, stop flattering me.

63
00:04:18,279 --> 00:04:20,000
Eat, everyone. Eat more.

64
00:04:21,399 --> 00:04:24,959
Aunt, what's the name of this soup?

65
00:04:24,959 --> 00:04:26,120
I can tell you about it.

66
00:04:26,519 --> 00:04:28,879
It's your aunt's specialty soup,

67
00:04:29,279 --> 00:04:33,680
egg drop soup with seaweed,
goji berries, ginseng, and deer antler.

68
00:04:33,759 --> 00:04:35,680
Xu Xian, it's all yours.

69
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:37,360
I think Aunt really worked hard today.

70
00:04:37,759 --> 00:04:38,759
I'll make another toast.

71
00:04:39,839 --> 00:04:40,879
That's right.

72
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:42,120
Cheers.

73
00:04:43,079 --> 00:04:44,439
Why toast with no wine?

74
00:04:44,439 --> 00:04:45,839
- Thank you, Aunt.
- Thank you.

75
00:04:45,839 --> 00:04:46,839
Just refill it.

76
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:48,800
Is my cooking that bad?

77
00:04:53,439 --> 00:04:55,519
- No.
- Not at all.

78
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:56,600
- No.
- No.

79
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:57,600
Of course not, Aunt.

80
00:04:57,959 --> 00:04:59,040
It's delicious.

81
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:21,959
It's very good.

82
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,040
- Right.
- Right.

83
00:05:24,199 --> 00:05:25,279
- It's great.
- It is.

84
00:05:25,279 --> 00:05:26,720
- Aunt.
- It's really good.

85
00:05:27,079 --> 00:05:28,279
Then why aren't you eating?

86
00:05:50,319 --> 00:05:51,319
Fang.

87
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:57,160
It's good, really good.

88
00:06:00,279 --> 00:06:01,879
You guys keep eating.

89
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:04,079
I'll go get a jar of wine.

90
00:06:14,319 --> 00:06:15,319
It's good.

91
00:06:18,319 --> 00:06:19,560
Very good.

92
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:54,079
Wenhui? Wenhui?

93
00:06:54,399 --> 00:06:57,720
Wenhui? Wenhui? Wenhui?

94
00:07:04,759 --> 00:07:05,759
What is this?

95
00:07:09,279 --> 00:07:11,519
It looks like the talisman
that killed the Rakshasa Bird.

96
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:14,199
It's Changming's talisman.

97
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:21,040
Who's Changming?

98
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:23,279
Uncle, wait here at home.

99
00:07:23,279 --> 00:07:24,279
Don't go anywhere.

100
00:07:26,279 --> 00:07:27,279
Let's go.

101
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:41,519
The aura is faint,

102
00:07:42,319 --> 00:07:44,120
but this direction should be right.

103
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:47,920
Found it.

104
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:51,439
Wait. Something feels off.

105
00:07:52,199 --> 00:07:53,319
We didn't go to them,

106
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:55,319
but they came to provoke us.

107
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:57,759
It was too easy. Could it be a trap?

108
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:01,759
Even so, I have to go.

109
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:03,480
I'll face any danger.

110
00:08:04,079 --> 00:08:05,079
Let's all be careful.

111
00:08:46,879 --> 00:08:48,039
Such a dense, dark aura.

112
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:51,080
(Demons must be infesting this place.)

113
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:53,879
(Not strong, but many in number.)

114
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,120
Be careful, everyone.

115
00:09:30,039 --> 00:09:31,240
I don't see anything.

116
00:09:32,919 --> 00:09:33,919
Strange.

117
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:36,919
How can Aunt's aura just vanish here?

118
00:09:38,559 --> 00:09:40,960
Xu Xian, look.

119
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:21,120
Careful!

120
00:10:22,559 --> 00:10:23,559
Xu Xian!

121
00:10:23,559 --> 00:10:24,559
Wait.

122
00:10:26,039 --> 00:10:27,200
The mural looks very sinister.

123
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:32,720
I'm worried it has its own rules.

124
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:34,559
What if we go inside,

125
00:10:35,039 --> 00:10:36,240
and our appearances change,

126
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:37,360
or we get separated?

127
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:39,879
That would be really dangerous for us.

128
00:10:42,279 --> 00:10:43,279
Listen to me.

129
00:10:43,279 --> 00:10:44,919
Fahai, you have the least power.

130
00:10:44,919 --> 00:10:45,919
You stay out here.

131
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,759
If Qing and I run into trouble inside,

132
00:10:48,879 --> 00:10:50,320
you can back us up from out here.

133
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:53,120
I'm the weakest?

134
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:54,840
Well, aren't you?

135
00:10:57,639 --> 00:11:00,960
Fine. If you two look down
on me that much...

136
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:06,320
These artifacts can keep us in touch.

137
00:11:06,679 --> 00:11:09,399
With these bells,
we can always find each other.

138
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:18,600
Qing.

139
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:30,279
Here, come look at this.

140
00:11:34,759 --> 00:11:35,759
Look at it.

141
00:11:35,759 --> 00:11:36,759
Not bad, right?

142
00:11:37,519 --> 00:11:38,519
Look at the fine hide.

143
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:41,360
Let's go.

144
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:46,120
Look, it's fresh.

145
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:48,240
Very tender indeed.

146
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:50,639
So this is the demon world.

147
00:11:53,720 --> 00:11:56,120
Who could have pulled off
something so grand

148
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:58,519
as to create a whole demon world

149
00:11:58,759 --> 00:12:00,480
(Myriad Demons House)
behind a mural?

150
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:04,279
Suzhen, I have a weird feeling
about this place.

151
00:12:08,639 --> 00:12:11,679
I feel like something
is draining my power.

152
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:13,159
Let's find them and leave.

153
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:28,080
That should do it.

154
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:31,480
If Qing, who has a big mouth,

155
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:32,559
gets me dragged in there,

156
00:12:33,960 --> 00:12:34,960
that could be dangerous.

157
00:12:50,159 --> 00:12:52,240
How can I break the contract?

158
00:12:54,480 --> 00:12:55,679
The little demon next door.

159
00:12:57,159 --> 00:12:59,639
Suzhen, look.
They're selling human pets.

160
00:13:03,679 --> 00:13:05,039
If Fahai were here,

161
00:13:05,039 --> 00:13:06,360
he'd surely fetch a good price.

162
00:13:09,440 --> 00:13:10,440
Let's go.

163
00:13:17,240 --> 00:13:18,240
Oh no, oh no.

164
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:19,320
I'm not going in.

165
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:21,120
I'm not going in.

166
00:13:21,120 --> 00:13:22,679
I'm not going in. I'm not going in.

167
00:13:23,279 --> 00:13:24,279
I'm not going in.

168
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:36,240
I knew it.

169
00:13:37,039 --> 00:13:39,200
Suzhen, we all landed here.

170
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:40,559
Xu Xian must be around, right?

171
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:44,320
We must not delay.

172
00:13:44,320 --> 00:13:45,399
Let's go find him.

173
00:13:48,080 --> 00:13:49,360
Let's go check it out there.

174
00:13:49,600 --> 00:13:50,840
There are some human hunters.

175
00:13:50,840 --> 00:13:51,879
- Yes.
- They're hunting now.

176
00:13:51,879 --> 00:13:52,879
I can smell it from here.

177
00:13:52,919 --> 00:13:53,919
Come on, let's look.

178
00:13:53,919 --> 00:13:54,919
Human hunters?

179
00:14:24,654 --> 00:14:28,813
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

180
00:14:31,280 --> 00:14:35,658
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

181
00:14:37,201 --> 00:14:43,026
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

182
00:14:43,795 --> 00:14:48,262
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

183
00:14:51,127 --> 00:14:55,568
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

184
00:14:57,764 --> 00:15:02,494
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

185
00:15:03,706 --> 00:15:09,819
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

186
00:15:10,482 --> 00:15:16,264
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

187
00:15:16,264 --> 00:15:22,527
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

188
00:15:22,837 --> 00:15:29,196
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

189
00:15:29,367 --> 00:15:36,734
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

190
00:15:37,019 --> 00:15:42,566
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

191
00:15:43,057 --> 00:15:49,267
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

192
00:15:49,577 --> 00:15:56,350
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

193
00:15:57,347 --> 00:16:03,000
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

194
00:16:03,834 --> 00:16:08,242
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

195
00:16:09,007 --> 00:16:11,595
♪Having ever loved♪
